{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑myベットです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前にもブログにのせたベットです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもシーツとか変わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このカーテンみたいなのあるじゃないですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがやっぱり虫除けにしか見えなくて......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真なんかみて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"THE 虫除け"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですよ...トホホ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このカーテンみたいなの取りたくて...でもこれ着けるのに一人で凄く凄く時間がかかったのでとるのもったいないし......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぉしようか迷っていますつまらない悩みなんだけどどーしたらいいかなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイ可愛い♪ハムスターに似てるって思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもマイマイはまぁやのことハムちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼ぶの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからお互いハムちゃんって呼んでるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね、まぁやはマイマイがギター弾いたりしてるとこ凄く好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも一生懸命なとこが大好きなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒し系でいつも癒されてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃん＆れなりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも頑張りやさんで、\n尊敬するところが沢山ありすぎます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きよーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも温かいコメントをありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人楽しみに読んでます\n大切な時間をまあやにコメントをくれて、ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間も、文も、長い方も短めの方もそれぞれに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくその人の気持ちが伝わってきて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪形もショートが似合ってる！って言う意見が多かったですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなアレンジをしてみるから、また意見を聞かせて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは今\n満員電車に乗って学校にいっております...汗汗\n皆は電車？バス？自転車？...どうやって行ってますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は質問返しとかしようかなぁ\nと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/25/6547920/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}